# The build context is only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else stays out, above all .env (secrets) and the
# 9 GB .venv. voices/ goes in (the clips are baked into the image: keep the image in a private registry). When the
# Dockerfile copies something new, add it here.
*
!requirements.txt
!app
!static
!config
!scripts
scripts/*
!scripts/stack
!voices
!run.sh
!stop.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
